<DIV><FONT size=2>I'm using Simple DNS from JHSoft.&nbsp; We support only a few 
web sites and I'd like to swap secondary services with someone in a similar 
position.</FONT></DIV>
<DIV><FONT size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT size=2>We have a static IP, DSL line and a 24/7 set of web, SQL, mail 
and now a DNS server.&nbsp; As I said, we are hosting about 10 web sites, web 
and DNS traffic is almost nothing.&nbsp; Everything is on lightly loaded APC 
battery backups so we are very seldom down.</FONT></DIV>
<DIV><FONT size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV><FONT size=2>I'd like to swap with someone also using Simple DNS to take 
advantage of the trusted zone file transfer option.</FONT></DIV>
