mention what the forecast says - without directly being asked.
    </pre>
  </blockquote>
  <pre wrap=""""><!---->
My guess is it's more insidious than that, it's going to be ActiveSpam.

""Oh, you're going to Seattle? I can get you airline tickets for less""

Yuck
  </pre>
</blockquote>
<br>
</body>
</html>",ham
