"URL: http://diveintomark.org/archives/2002/09/25.html#foaf_explorer Date: 2002-09-25T18:18:53-05:00 Morten Frederiksen has taken a first stab at a real-time social network explorer based on FOAF files. You could start on my profile[1] and explore from there, or enter the URL of your own FOAF file (at the bottom of the page). It's heavy on tech details, but you can easily see the potential here. (It's also a great way to debug your FOAF file, if you added anything manually.) Now we need somebody to build a spider that follows foaf:knows links and draws pretty social network diagrams, so we can see the forest for the trees. [1] http://xml.mfd-consult.dk/foaf/?foaf=http%3A%2F%2Fdiveintomark.org%2Fpublic%2Ffoaf.rdf",,ham
