"<html> <head> <meta http-equiv=""Content-Type"" content=""text/html; charset=iso-8859-1""> <title>Lowest Life Insurance Quotes</title> <style>td {font-family: arial}</style> </head> <body bgcolor=""#ffffff""> <div STYLE=""FONT-FAMILY:TIMES""><b><font face=""ARIAL"" color=""blue"" size=""6""> <p align=""center"">The Lowest Life Insurance Quotes</font></b> <br> <b><i><font face=""arial"" color=""red"" size=""5"">Without the Hassle!</font></i></b> </p> <p align=""center""><font face=""ARIAL"" color=""black"" size=""4"">Compare rates from the nation's top insurance companies</font> <br> <a HREF=""http://216.49.109.1/95-2/index.htm""><b><font face=""ARIAL"" color=""blue"" size=""5"">Shop, Compare and Save</font></b></a> </p> <p align=""center""><b><font face=""ARIAL"" color=""black"" size=""5"">Fill out the simple form, and you'll have the <br> 15 best custom quotes in</font><font face=""ARIAL"" color=""red"" size=""5""> 1 minute.</font></b> </p> <p align=""center""><a HREF=""http://216.49.109.1/95-2/index.htm""><font face=""arial"" color=""blue"" size=""4""><b>COMPARE YOUR CURRENT COVERAGE</b></font></a> <br> <font face=""arial"" color=""blue"" size=""3"">to these sample 10-year level term monthly premiums <br> (20 year, 30 year and smoker rates also available)</font> </p> <div align=""center""><center> <table border=""0"" WIDTH=""468""> <tr> <td ALIGN=""CENTER"" bgcolor=""#ffffff""></td> <td ALIGN=""CENTER"" COLSPAN=""2"" bgcolor=""#EEE8F6"">$250,000</td> <td ALIGN=""CENTER"" COLSPAN=""2"" bgcolor=""#F2F2A1"">$500,000</td> <td ALIGN=""CENTER"" COLSPAN=""2"" bgcolor=""#D0F4E5"">$1,000,000</td> </tr> <tr> <td bgcolor=""#3B2556""><font color=""#ffffff"">Age</font></td> <td bgcolor=""#3B2556""><font color=""#ffffff"">Male</font></td> <td bgcolor=""#3B2556""><font color=""#ffffff"">Female</font></td> <td bgcolor=""#3B2556""><font color=""#ffffff"">Male</font></td> <td bgcolor=""#3B2556""><font color=""#ffffff"">Female</font></td> <td bgcolor=""#3B2556""><font color=""#ffff