><b>Mail Order Business</b></font></td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""12%"" align=""center""><input type=""radio"" value=""internet"" name=""Type_Business""></td> <td width=""88%""><font size=""2""><b>Internet Based Business</b></font></td> </tr> </table> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""61%"" align=""right""><b><font size=""2"">Personal Credit Rating:</font></b></td> <td width=""39%""> <div align=""left""> <table border=""0"" width=""95%""> <tr> <td width=""12%"" align=""center""><input type=""radio"" value=""excellent"" name=""Credit_Rank""></td> <td width=""88%"">Excellent</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""12%"" align=""center""><input type=""radio"" value=""good"" name=""Credit_Rank""></td> <td width=""88%"">Good</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""12%"" align=""center""><input type=""radio"" value=""fair"" name=""Credit_Rank""></td> <td width=""88%"">Fair</td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""12%"" align=""center""><input type=""radio"" value=""poor"" name=""Credit_Rank""></td> <td width=""88%"">Poor</td> </tr> </table> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""61%"" align=""right""><b><font size=""2"">How Soon Would You Like a Merchant Account?</font></b></td> <td width=""39%""> <p align=""center""><input type=""text"" name=""How_Soon"" size=""29""></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td width=""100%"" colspan=""2""> <div align=""center""> <center> <table border=""0"" width=""13%""> <tr> <td width=""100%""> <p align=""center""><input type=""submit"" value=""Submit"" name=""B1""></td> </tr> </table> </center> </div> </td></form> </tr> </table> </div><br> <div align=""center""> <center> <table border=""3"" cellspacing=""0"" width=""85%"" bgcolor=""#E8E8E8"" bordercolor=""#C0C0C0""> <tr> <td width=""100%"" bgcolor=""#E8E8E8""><font size=""2""><b>Your information is confidential, it will not be sold or used for any other purpose, and you are under no obligation. Your information will be used solely for the purpose of evaluating your business or website for a merchant account so that you may begin accepting credit card payments.</b></font> </td> </tr> </table> </center> </div> </form> <p align=""center""> <br><b><font size=""3"" color=""#FF0000"">List Removal/OPT-OUT Option</font></b> <br><b><font color=""#000000""><font size=-1><a href=""mailto:ieg016@yahoo.com?subject=remove"">Click Here</a></font></font></b>m </body> </html> </x-html>",,spam
