</b>5. <b>No &quot;feast or famine&quot;</b> activity.&nbsp; Leads will be coming in <br>
regularly.&nbsp; You dictate the flow!<br><br>
6. <b>No more cold calls!&nbsp; </b>We tell your prospects you'll be calling.<br><br>
