  <font face=""verdana, arial"" size=""2"" color=""#FFFFFF""><p><img src=""http://www.sancristobalsa.net/letter/images/starfish.gif"" width=""20"" height=""16"">&nbsp;&nbsp;The investment will be totally private and protected from lawsuits.</p></font>
                                               <font face=""verdana, arial"" size=""2"" color=""#FFFFFF""><p><img src=""http://www.sancristobalsa.net/letter/images/starfish.gif"" width=""20"" height=""16"">&nbsp;&nbsp;The plantation has a proven track record.</p></font>
                                                <font face=""verdana, arial"" size=""2"" color=""#FFFFFF""><p><img src=""http://www.sancristobalsa.net/letter/images/starfish.gif"" width=""20"" height=""16"">&nbsp;&nbsp;Total turnkey system is provided - You buy the real estate. The Management Company plants, maintains, and harvests your crop.&nbsp; You deposit the quarterly cash returns.</p></font>
                                            </UL>
